sequenceDiagram
    participant O as DAG 编排器
    participant D as 当前 Design execution
    participant L as Lead
    participant W as 后续 Writer execution
    participant S as Managed mailbox snapshot
    participant G as Git worktree

    O->>D: 派发 eng_design activation
    D->>O: turn
    O-->>D: yours phase=design
    D->>D: 产出 docs、diagram、HTML
    D->>L: 请求 design review
    L-->>D: APPROVED
    D->>L: 发布并报告 Founder HTML
    D->>O: phase_design_complete
    Note over D,G: 当前没有 exact marker，probe.txt 保持不存在

    alt 后续 execution 没有 exact marker
        W->>O: turn = yours
        W->>L: report no marker + tpl_code route mismatch
        W->>O: park，等待 owner close/cancel/retemplate
        Note over W,G: fail closed：不写 probe、不造 PR、不发明 no-code route
    else 后续 execution 收到绑定自身的 native exact-marker instruction
        L->>W: Append the exact line … to probe.txt
        W->>O: turn
        O-->>W: yours
        W->>S: 参数化查询 sender/recipient/content
        S-->>W: 唯一 LEASED/ACKED mailbox row
        W->>W: grammar parser 写 exact bytes + LF temp file
        W->>G: grep -F -f exact-line count
        W->>G: cat temp file append，校验 staged diff
        W->>G: local commit only
        W->>L: 回执 instruction id、content hash 与 commit SHA
        W->>O: park，由 owner 处理不兼容 route
    end
